{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bloodmist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A remote settlement, long abandoned, is swallowed by an unnatural red mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locals whisper of a curse \u2014 those who enter never return, and their screams echo in the fog long after they vanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something moves within the Bloodmist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something that hungers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team have been sent to cleanse the area\u2026 but the mist is alive, twisting your senses and drawing you toward things that should not exist. As the ritual begins, you realize the true horror: the mist is spreading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ritual Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find cursed relics scattered across the map. Bring them to the altar while avoiding the creature stalking you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Together \u2014 or Die Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Game. Split up to cover more ground, or stay close to share your limited light sources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and cleanse cursed items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the creature \u2014 once it sees you, run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Bloodmist\u2026 if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372930/extras/733c76caf923cefbd0fe9915f6b02bf0.avif?t=1771026002\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2372930?t=1771026002","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372930/91ccdecefee7836b9fe7d9155949721405dd47a4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771026002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama